{"section":{"id":"cet4-2025-06-set2-news-report-1","examId":"cet4-2025-06-set2","title":"新闻 1","kind":"新闻","start":44.27,"end":123.07,"preview":"A Florida teenager and an Atlanta woman won the overall men's and women's divisions Saturday at the annual 7 Mile Bridge Run.","lines":[{"start":44.27,"end":54.67,"text":"A Florida teenager and an Atlanta woman won the overall men's and women's divisions Saturday at the annual 7 Mile Bridge Run."},{"start":54.67,"end":61.95,"text":"Vaclav Bursa, 15, of Big Pine Key, Florida, finished first overall."},{"start":61.95,"end":69.63,"text":"He completed the race in 41 minutes and one second and claimed the top spot in the men's division."},{"start":69.63,"end":73.95,"text":"Bursa won third place in the 2022 race."},{"start":73.95,"end":76.99,"text":"He is a student at Marathon High School."},{"start":76.99,"end":85.31,"text":"Joanna Stephens, 28, of Atlanta, completed the course in 41 minutes and 12 seconds."},{"start":85.31,"end":90.18,"text":"She won the women's division title and placed second overall."},{"start":90.18,"end":94.82,"text":"The race drew competitors from 41 U.S. states."},{"start":94.82,"end":101.87,"text":"There were also runners from other countries, including Canada, the UK and Switzerland."},{"start":101.87,"end":109.46,"text":"The run closed the span between the Middle and Lower Keys to traffic for three hours Saturday."},{"start":109.46,"end":116.1,"text":"The April contest is one of the most popular running events in the southeastern United States."},{"start":116.1,"end":123.07,"text":"The race field filled within minutes after online registration opened in January."}],"audio":"assets/audio/e24a7dfeb3ab7f9c71d141f92465bade487dd7202f25ba041123f1207030f884.wav","audioOffset":44.27},"tasks":[{"id":"0-0","text":"A Florida teenager and an Atlanta woman won the overall men's and women's divisions Saturday at the annual 7 Mile Bridge Run.","start":44.27,"end":54.67,"legacyTaskIds":["0-0"],"legacyTaskIndices":[0]